  "description": "<p data-end=\"446\" data-start=\"119\"><strong data-end=\"144\" data-start=\"119\">Brand Introduction:</strong><br data-end=\"147\" data-start=\"144\">East Coast Sod is New England&rsquo;s top choice for premium farm-fresh sod. With locations in Massachusetts and New Hampshire, we specialize in fast, reliable delivery of Bluegrass-Fescue sod to homeowners and contractors. Our team is passionate about helping people create beautiful, healthy lawns&mdash;fast.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"742\" data-start=\"448\"><strong data-end=\"474\" data-start=\"448\">&bull; Product Description:</strong><br data-end=\"477\" data-start=\"474\">We sell high-quality Bluegrass-Fescue sod in convenient 10 sq ft rolls. Customers can order online and have it delivered straight to their door&mdash;fresh from the farm. We also offer special seasonal deals, like 1,000 sq ft (2 pallets) with free delivery for only $599.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"779\" data-start=\"744\"><strong data-end=\"777\" data-start=\"744\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1031\" data-start=\"780\">\r\n<li data-end=\"840\" data-start=\"780\">\r\n<p data-end=\"840\" data-start=\"782\">$599 promo for 1,000 sq ft of sod with <strong data-end=\"838\" data-start=\"821\">free delivery</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"896\" data-start=\"841\">\r\n<p data-end=\"896\" data-start=\"843\">Fast turnaround and delivery within 3 business days</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"948\" data-start=\"897\">\r\n<p data-end=\"948\" data-start=\"899\">Easy online ordering&mdash;no hassle for the customer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1031\" data-start=\"949\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1031\" data-start=\"951\">The only sod company in the region offering this kind of convenience and pricing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1180\" data-start=\"1033\"><strong data-end=\"1053\" data-start=\"1033\">&bull; Payment Terms:</strong><br data-end=\"1056\" data-start=\"1053\">Affiliates earn <strong data-end=\"1090\" data-start=\"1072\">10% commission</strong> on every sale. Payouts are made monthly via PayPal or direct deposit. No cap on earnings.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1208\" data-start=\"1182\"><strong data-end=\"1206\" data-start=\"1182\">&bull; Other Information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1524\" data-start=\"1209\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1302\" data-start=\"1209\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1302\" data-start=\"1211\">No experience needed&mdash;perfect for influencers, contractors, and lawn care content creators</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1356\" data-start=\"1303\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1356\" data-start=\"1305\">Custom affiliate links provided for easy tracking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1448\" data-start=\"1357\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1448\" data-start=\"1359\">Works great for home &amp; garden bloggers, YouTube lawn care channels, and TikTok creators</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1524\" data-start=\"1449\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1524\" data-start=\"1451\">Our average order value is $600&ndash;$1,500, meaning high commissions per sale</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
